  "body": "Auction: 8-12 The Promenade, Takapuna on Wednesday 16 December 2026 at 9:30AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nHow often do you find a single level home on a flat, generous 980m² section that sits directly on the edge of the Orewa estuary?\r\n\r\nStep straight out of your gate onto the Orewa Te Ara Tahuna estuary  walkway. Drag out your kayak or paddle board for some peaceful solitude on the high tide; or simply enjoy the view from your armchair. \r\n\r\nEnter through the wide, long hallway and immediately feel the home's welcoming warmth. Designed for effortless living, the kitchen and bathrooms have been modernized, bringing a contemporary edge to a home that delivers on every front.\r\n\r\nThe classic wishlist is fully satisfied: single level ease, four bedrooms plus versatile spaces, a double internal access garage, and a large flat yard for the kids or pets. \r\n\r\nProperties in this position are tightly held, fiercely protected by their owners, and almost impossible to replace. You're not just buying a home; you are buying the Orewa coastal lifestyle.  \r\n\r\nUnbeatable Lifestyle And Convenience:\r\n\r\n• Step from your lawn onto the Orewa Te Ara Tahuna estuary walkway.\r\n• Short flat walk to Orewa beach or the village cafes and shops.\r\n• Large flat site offering space for family, and a gorgeous garden to potter in. \r\n• Orewa College a short walk away and child care in the next street.\r\n• Public bus with city connections around the corner.\r\n\r\nWhether you are looking to secure a foothold in a premier coastal position, accommodate family, or downsize without compromising on land and space, opportunities on the estuary edge simply do not repeat themselves.\r\n\r\nDon’t watch from the sidelines, get in touch today!",
